% Gravity tree accuracy, 'default' variant: evrard IC, fixed gas softening
% (no ADAPTIVE_GRAVSOFT_FORGAS), so every softening branch of the walk is the plain one.
% Run twice by test_gravtree.py: with the opening criterion below, and converged towards
% direct summation (ErrTolTheta=0.15, ErrTolForceAcc=1e-6); the per-particle difference is
% the production tree error.
InitCondFile                       ../evrard/evrard_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            0.05
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.025
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.001
DesNumNgb                          40
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
GravityConstantInternal            1
SofteningGas                       0.01
SofteningHalo                      0.07
Softening_Type2                    0.003
Softening_Type3                    0.003
Softening_Type4                    0.003
Softening_Type5                    0.003
CourantFac                         0.1
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
TimeBetStatistics                  0.5
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
DomainBuild_ActiveFraction         0.005
